,3],[16,0.3,33,2],[3,0.2,127,1]],[["fbb54ed4_9d217ed9",42,0,0,"This needs to be a GM2 color, otherwise it will render as red."]],0,260],[7155720,20407,4,0.259,0.185,[[3,128]],[],0,261],[7164238,20410,9,0.421,0.3,[[3,0.417,129,4],[8,0.333,103,3],[16,0.25,34,2]],[["0da10072_3b928860",32,0,1,"nit: No colors addressed in this CL."]],0,262],[7169469,20410,160,0.035,0.017,[[18,0.871,0,140],[19,0.129,0,20]],[],0,263],[7160957,20410,8,0.421,0.3,[[3,0.7,130,6],[16,0.3,35,2]],[["974881a9_ee567960",40,-1,0,"Do you mind adding a justification for why this is being removed to the description?"],["d9abe11c_f6794b13",40,-1,0,"I'm a little confused where this positioning is set. We can get rid of the usages of these variables in composebox.css if they are no longer used."],["36ce7e5d_f9dec952",40,0,0,"The styling still looks off when you hover, at least in variant 3[1]. I think the correct styling should be `--cr-composebox-suggestion-activity-bottom` set to `-10px` based off [2].…"]],0,263],[7169737,20410,2,0.143,0.09,[[8,104]],[],0,263],[7173236,20412,4,0.29,0.183,[[3,0.5,130,2],[16,0.5,35,2]],[["e0e1e6b5_465c7273",40,0,1,"Could we add `--cr-icon-button-icon-size` here instead of adding a new variable? That way we have one less dependency on `ntp-realbox-next-enabled`."],["e241b7f2_f9b0edad",40,0,1,"Sorry, I meant like this: ```suggestion --cr-icon-button-icon-size: 20px; ``` It should work similar to `--cr-icon-button-size: 28px;` on line 68."]],0,264],[7181835,20424,17,0.737,0.556,[[3,0.684,131,12],[16,0.316,36,5]],[["81b714c2_6f1cf410",43,-1,0,"Same question here, does this not affect the NTP team? Or is the effect intentional?"],["9e27297f_8970fda3",43,-1,0,"Does removing this not affect the NTP team? Or is the effect intentional?"],["72e7e308_30695f68",40,0,1,"nit: let's preserve this list's alphabetical order."],["92544fa2_b46e611e",40,0,1,"nit: Don't these (and `--cr-composebox-file-thumbnail-remove-button-fill-color`) work the same if they go underneath `cr-composebox` on line 41? I have the same question for the rest of the CSS…"]],0,265],[7236047,20431,216,4.183,3.38,[[16,0.583,37,129],[4,0.281,80,63],[8,0.098,105,17],[3,0.03,132,6],[20,0.009,0,1]],[["033658c7_6423e7f1",44,-1,1,"optional: shorten since this is already in the context of a `composebox` file. ```suggestion <cr-button id=\"lensSearch\" class=\"lens-search\" ```"],["03639a84_ce8024be",45,-1,1,"optional: could shorten these querySelector calls if you import $$ from `chrome://webui-test/test_util.js` ```suggestion const button = $$(lensSearch, 'cr-button'); ```"],["42017fe0_ad40e92f",46,-1,1,"Should be protected and moved closer to `showRecentTabChip_` as it is should be set by the loadtimedata. The other composeboxes would then set `composeboxShowLensChip` to false e.g. [1], to prevent a…"],["697b9747_d318a58e",47,-1,1,"Few things: 1. Since this is hardcoded, you should just apply it right in the HTML, like [1]. To test the value of the \"label\" in the test, check the trimmed `textContent` e.g. [3]. 2. Same as [1],…"],["880f4ac3_c3cd10c8",39,-1,1,"nit: `contextual-chip` doesn't accurately describe the \"image upload button\" (in the html.ts file). I think we should either: a) rename this to something comprehensive, like `.upload-button` OR b)…"],["941a47a5_7b2038d5",48,-1,1,"nit: remove extra line to remain in line with file's styling"],["970e2af5_44cf5788",45,-1,0,"nit: Can this be moved inside of the test that uses it?"],["9b400fd0_6ebd5e95",49,-1,1,"Few things. 1. This should be moved to the shared localized string list for searchboxes[1], otherwise we risk those searchboxes crashing if other composebox owners decide to surface this chip. 2.…"],["c9510165_127014fe",46,-1,1,"Remove new line ```suggestion protected accessor submitButtonShown: boolean = false; protected get inToolMode_(): boolean { ```"],["e2c8b625_52ceedec",46,-1,1,"Is this needed? I don't think it is doing anything."],["eae76c7c_1890bcdf",44,-1,1,"does this need both an id and a class attribute, since they both are being used for one thing? ```suggestion <cr-button id=\"composeboxLensSearch\" ```"],["ee70792f_bdab1d14",44,-1,1,"optional: can be shortened since in a `composebox` context already ```suggestion @click=\"${this.onLensSearchClick_}\"> ```"],["f85df637_a70c2099",50,-1,1,"Move this to where the rest of the composebox strings are, which starts on line 330."],["f8b0e9a6_f8e7e6da",51,-1,0,"Good call on making it this way so the NTP team knows to add their own colors if they ever want to make their own version of this chip + make its easy to share between this and the other chips."],["fbdfe447_5c2e4c42",46,-1,1,"nit: remove this method in this CL, and allow Khalid to add it in his own. In case the click handling ends up not needing to be routed through here."]],0,266],[7254699,20434,13,0.562,0.384,[[16,0.588,38,8],[8,0.294,106,4],[3,0.118,133,1]],[["f56854e2_8c17afed",52,0,0,"Do we not want the ability to toggle this via some feature param?"]],0,267],[7256994,20435,86,2.257,1.837,[[4,0.851,81,73],[16,0.149,39,11]],[["55e81d48_bf04f605",53,0,1,"optional: consider shortening test and removing the extra tab info since we just want to make sure nothing shwos"],["5d87c031_ac0ee44a",53,0,1,"nit: can probably remove this test altogether"],["cc3852c1_ae46bac6",53,0,1,"nit: test needs to be renamed"]],0,268],[7263844,20438,2,0.143,0.09,[[3,134]],[],0,269],[7269357,20439,83,2.257,1.837,[[4,0.892,82,73],[16,0.108,40,8]],[],0,270],[7272486,20440,2,0.167,0.139,[[16,40]],[],0,270],[7278416,20440,1,0.089,0.062,[[2,32]],[],0,271],[7308888,20445,9,0.562,0.384,[[16,0.818,41,8],[3,0.182,135,1]],[],0,272],[7309291,20446,75,1.862,1.483,[[16,0.707,42,53],[3,0.293,136,22]],[["2e19be6d_4ae57921",48,-1,1,"Nit: showContextualChipsInCompactMode"],["684252e6_ad283c5c",48,-1,1,"Don't think this can change? Maybe this should depend on tabSuggestions? And then you use the compute method on line 300?"]],0,273],[7364057,20453,5,0.29,0.183,[[16,0.714,43,4],[3,0.286,137,1]],[],0,274]]}